      "basis": "editorial",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "store",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1684660/",
          "sourceId": "steam-store",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-11-08T02:35:41Z",
          "quote": "「ナツノカナタ」は、終末を迎えた世界を旅する少女たちを描いた、テキストアドベンチャーゲームです。",
          "originKey": "store:steam",
          "fetchHash": "sha256:97a10e3359110b10e65be3ba3e5791ff27c899d30211d6e2273f71abf4a8a46e"
        },
        {
          "kind": "store",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1684660/",
          "sourceId": "steam-store",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-11-08T02:35:41Z",
          "quote": "どういうわけか別の世界を生きる少女と通話を繋げてしまったあなたは、彼女たちの旅に巻き込まれていきます。",
          "originKey": "store:steam",
          "fetchHash": "sha256:97a10e3359110b10e65be3ba3e5791ff27c899d30211d6e2273f71abf4a8a46e"
        }
      ],
      "asOf": "2026-11-08",
      "status": "adopted",
      "statusReason": "highest-rank",
      "adoptedAt": "2026-11-08T02:52:07Z",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T02:52:07Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-08T02:52:07Z",
      "lastCheckedAt": "2026-11-08T02:35:41Z",
      "createdBy": "llm",
      "createdByRun": "42438991793",
      "field": "summary",
      "value": {
        "ja": "終末を迎えた世界を旅する少女ナツノと、祖母の遺品の古いパソコンを通じて通話がつながった主人公。彼女たちの旅を見守りながら、崩壊した世界の謎に迫るテキストアドベンチャー。"
      }
    },
